    "text": "A statue of height <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>m</mtext></math> stands on a tower of height <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>m</mtext><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;The angle subtended by the statue at the eyes of an observer of height <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>m</mtext><mo>,</mo></math> standing at a distance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>m</mtext></math> from base of the tower is",
